New team feature flag `isolatedMembers` (locked and disabled by default, settable only via the internal API / stern). When enabled, members of a team are isolated from each other: being in the same team no longer counts as being connected (1-1 conversations, adding members to conversations), and regular members can no longer discover other members of their team (user search, team member lists, team conversations, team notifications, collaborators, user groups, rich info, broadcast mismatch reports, user and member-leave events). Team admins and owners can still see all members.
